<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n89625" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσκολλ-άω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>glue on</i> or <i>to</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι πρός τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Art.</u>
					33
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, generally, <i>to be stuck to, stick</i> or <i>cleave
				to</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				82e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lg.</u>
				728b
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ αἵματος προσκολληθῆναι τὴν
					ῥομφαίαν αὐτοῦ τῇ δεξιᾷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					7.12.4
				</span></i>
			; of a snail, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς θαμνίσκοις
			π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				2.9
			</span></i>; of a husband, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τῇ γυναικί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ev.Matt.</u>
					19.5
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ge.</u>
				2.24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Marc.</u>
				10.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.Eph.</u>
				5.31
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς ἐπαοιδοῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Le.</u>
					19.31
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχαὶ π. θεῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					51
				</span></i>
			 H. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr. of
			style, <i>to be compact</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Dem.</u>
				43
			</span></i>.</div>
